OL,3,AAmazon pauses work with cargo firm
OL,4,Aafter fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FE-commerce giant Amazon says it is
OL,7,Fsuspending work with the firm that
OL,8,Foperated a cargo plane that was
OL,9,Finvolved in a fatal crash in Miami this
OL,10,Fmonth.
OL,12,F"After the tragic incident last
OL,13,Fweekend, we've spent time supporting
OL,14,Fthe investigation and reviewing some of
OL,15,Fthe surrounding circumstances, and
OL,16,Fwe've decided to pause our operations
OL,17,Fwith 21 Air," an Amazon spokesperson
OL,18,Fsaid on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
