OL,3,AAmazon pauses work with cargo firm
OL,4,Aafter fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 6 September, the 21 Air-operated
OL,7,FBoeing jet overshot a runway at Miami
OL,8,FInternational Airport and hit several
OL,9,Fvehicles, killing five people.
OL,11,FThe BBC has contacted 21 Air for
OL,12,Fcomment. The firm previously said it
OL,13,Fwas "devastated by the accident" and
OL,14,Fthat it is cooperating with authorities
OL,15,Fto investigate the incident.
